                "loc": "EXO.34.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 34.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in his right hand he held seven stars, from his mouth issued a sharp two-edged sword, and his face was like the sun shining in full strength.",
          "type": "text",
